nks\n\n- [[20261007001630-8807|Integration receipt: Independent C18 split-owner and exact write-set design adjudication]] [follows] — Implements and independently accepts the C18 design after causal RED and corrective GREEN review\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791906249221},"timestamp":"2026-10-13T15:44:09.222Z","cwd":"/Users/schwa/dev/lsp-trace"}
