view.\" — same topic / absent / durable\n\nnot in note: Corrected V3 exact-byte review independently reconciles the exact Stage A map and reruns a fresh disposable compile/vet rather than inheriting an earlier result.\n\nI will now run independent exact reconciliation, package verification, hashes/status, and a uniquely named disposable harness.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_086e788cb8bf6932016ace55139b7081919683cbdbdd6de7b4\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Updating note with latest mandates**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_086e788cb8bf6932016ace551a2a648191b85ca83058c05725\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqzlUb2YeRg9J6R-cmPM5brEq4vXtHYwUDamDpHauqstVGIHoMNeu5RY-Q95QqrHpf9804xwKWHpG6qVHgCqHPdrFpS__klGszU19be36DwCVEUJAxbJZQP9dHoTE4AVKsth0RmLW00o2aQTf9if4awYRoZoC3aGD3WiOmzPuem58Hk9Zb0YxkZtFCp3XsRYbtHU6vN3lKGnqDNk-l0UtfW0mfesVjNZgJ3JTX7M6vmC2YiEBj3h59dRUGVCyAGo1T8rGpVvTA8nsVyChaerxOtNezhE4CZ6W_kvFEgMCxHd9Nc2ow1dBGST84KfYeqo4btls94_6QrdcD5e5BaOXAPHbgCGROB8K9upcR-56SNBUcCR2TR90giMJTCzs-rQz6WGIpVYZrWDwdBzrqmaiikH6ungF7futkwitI5Opb38OpGokJol90i8adQ7rdLymoW58oy7gzUIOp7n_T_HlWdGHO5gE0ufpZ64keJYWIhkJYhe1d9eI1XX6q_uRgZW-DHMh6HowV5GExW-8LiIShhknPifbyacqqj9MFmJFPj-xhivF-y9hTpnx_qea8O8hwOXXObew96bZuDDvOqtzIus68wAs2m9JWZf3ihs6sMFh88szY7qtp3I1VKlEKzqA6w2NT-rUhOEA1ClOC81tculqgCS4C7ONSV7jU2V0UqJLDb773hKuzMkk8lGixq4TRvqyx_vEAooni97rlr_35Jmz-f0OY9-RkzqBzPH0cQQycuw4FIsvXmIbT8uuuat11LKHzCh2fDO35qAbzjVKugcwbCGO0W8Nw7vW5fm0VUy1vHO6KcqtmU6SrOazSaozSDZmeF76iFMGNZasekPtYHsOFp0-lFqanVLBI0HN45JVJN9miYEj3H7pa2b91qVYQUYGyE14yyhGqJ7vo0vuue2g62jFz7DqqSD58PRjVMGDOckTYcoGct0MnT8c5uhWD3jsgMontNZElJVX06KXonPXUoAQHzXwjMazVyo56_znb8Kp2Y56GtCWB8Kjoa4gKRo3-r0IdUK946hYT_0dMcAZXXnYjB8NsAnsbXqwzuaILvg_WYm2ktRp1pXkdJbqcXtAGuXricChkr7QIGYuyuZATaVXNMpXi6inlDbe3BsgAIHkKuOuOzte3k26jJRXxfzGwxMKcOtIwLVtA5AWtrkCpc2yqF-9HrI6L5gVUIqVof1P-a9KSh2tUntgg4HJoKyLV0H_dG7CkIciU9d1WPMBjBFZt3NCzJxOm-EnntH2nEmdkKHiqgbOMnxQWtvp4b_5UGiVxkgRU9S5fecniJ7C