Fzni2rQx73LwWjVPYgoyk8T0-o_jjbkiweZgiDJzbQLCwq1Fklj6r4xtHCgEb1Qx_oc9Y4bvNDCaErgWX9uDrfFSrYyr7PiXRTMdBvvYijEThaaSl9fpqbHcH7wiWhlB44gBkcQi7qPpYm49qGL7plbO-OrxMnAUipwLjk-VRDVqlciVdhbJ5XaGYYBFeYbdj3wet4aqJgnru6OR5czMR_7kHgIr8fQk20s1mfjnRocJiqba_hVf1yCRmYpFhVqg8no8vOLaBIiulj2Taf_mbCS_xHDB_URCwlRMA-A5pKohl5TR2JnNC-BVlvFDmQ8GIjefYtk3wF0CJW5GI4jhE1jJ1l0YEZC_CjF2y2f561OdQc2t_fyPKoL5VYtzoNP_VjoavVcKER2foLkbokNBIcMGlmvMQxTGbFahGoQGmRZx30Z6tIwaKR55EO5r94vN_9UAhtkAOyUeTr3yJ1AtFxh7Tim7WLclppxCFBDdQDvYOuAGReQFVoWx3sgiDPm_fDJeRVJilGbWs=\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"Loaded: witness (when: \"architecture review\" — not: \"scientific reasoning\" — because: the final acceptance token must be supported by inspectable evidence)\nLoaded: full (when: \"cover everything important\" — not: \"full picture\" — because: four corrected shapes and every prior green gate must be covered)\nLoaded: ground (when: \"derive what correctness means before acting\" — not: \"before implementing any code change\" — because: acceptance must remain bound to the frozen contract)\nLoaded: presume (when: \"make a call and move on\" — not: \"guess and adjust\" — because: the disposable harness path is a reversible choice)\nLoaded: atomic (when: \"one thing per step\" — not: \"don't bundle changes\" — because: shape, hash/status, and compile evidence must remain independently attributable)\nLoads verified: witness, full, ground, presume, atomic (5 of 5)\nToken loads complete.\n\nToken derivations:\n[witness]: \"architecture review\" → \"The response names each assumption and its epistemic basis in the same paragraph or numbered step before stating any conclusion that depends on it\" as applied here: the token follows exact observed checks.\n[full]: \"cover everything important\" → \"The response addresses every named element of the subject at one level of depth\" as applied here: all four corrections and prior gates are included.\n[ground]: \"derive what correctness means before acting\" → \"The response must produce a 'Ground properties:' block before any test, implementation step, tool call, or task reasoning begins\" as applied here: the fixed properties below govern acceptance.\nWhat it requires here: require all four formerly missing shapes and unchanged prior-green evidence.\n[presume]: \"make a call and move on\" → \"The response selects the most plausible option wherever the subject leaves a choice open and proceeds on it instead of stopping to request approval or clarification\" as applied here: use a unique `/tmp` harness.\nWhat it requires here: revise only if the package mandates another harness location.\n[atomic]: \"one thing per step\" → \"The response makes one observable change per step, where a step is a single unit of change\" as applied here: inspect shapes, verify package, and compile independently.\nWhat it requires here: preserve separate result boundaries.\nWithout witness, the final token would lack reconstructible support; without full, a correction or prior gate could be omitted.\nDerived stance complete.\n\nGround properties:\nInterpretation: issue the exact token only if the current package contains all four formerly absent call shapes, preserves every prior-green exact-byte criterion, and passes a fresh independent disposable compile/vet.\nproperty [1]: GO(p) ⇒ AddedShapes(p)={InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource,NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}\n§ formality check: property [1]: \"GO(p) ⇒ AddedShapes(p)={InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource,NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}\" — formal\n§ minimality: property [1]: minimal — most specific sub-term: \"ErrorCallback\"; candidate relaxation: omit \"ErrorCallback\"; rejected: it is one of the four requested corrections.\nproperty [1a]: GO(p) ⇒ {InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource}⊆AddedShapes(p)\nproperty [1b]: GO(p) ⇒ {NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}⊆AddedShapes(p)\n§ formality check: property [1a]: \"GO(p) ⇒ {InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource}⊆AddedShapes(p)\" — formal\n§ formality check: property [1b]: \"GO(p) ⇒ {NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}⊆AddedShapes(p)\" — formal\n§ split test: property [1]: \"GO(p) ⇒ AddedShapes(p)={InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource,NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}\" ⇔ (property [1a]: \"GO(p) ⇒ {InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource}⊆AddedShapes(p)\" ∧ property [1b]: \"GO(p) ⇒ {NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}⊆AddedShapes(p)\"); property [1a] — falsified by an omitted invalid-component call; property [1b] — falsified by an omitted error callback; these falsifiers are independent.\n§ constraint coverage: property [1]: covers {four added call shapes}\n§ atomic: property [1]: \"GO(p) ⇒ AddedShapes(p)={InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource,NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}\" — candidate split rejected: exact four-shape correction is one requested gate.\n\nproperty [2]: GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p) ∧ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\n§ formality check: property [2]: \"GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p) ∧ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\" — formal\n§ minimality: property [2]: minimal — most specific sub-term: \"Vet(h)\"; candidate relaxation: omit \"Vet(h)\"; rejected: fresh vet is explicitly required.\nproperty [2a]: GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p)\nproperty [2b]: GO(p) ⇒ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\n§ formality check: property [2a]: \"GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p)\" — formal\n§ formality check: property [2b]: \"GO(p) ⇒ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\" — formal\n§ split test: property [2]: \"GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p) ∧ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\" ⇔ (property [2a]: \"GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p)\" ∧ property [2b]: \"GO(p) ⇒ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\"); property [2a] — falsified by stale checksums with compiling declarations; property [2b] — falsified by compile failure with preserved bytes; these falsifiers are independent.\n§ constraint coverage: property [2]: covers {prior green criteria, checksums, status, fresh compile/vet}\n§ atomic: property [2]: \"GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p) ∧ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\" — candidate split rejected: these jointly define final preservation and reproducibility.\n\n§ completeness check: \"four added call shapes plus all prior green criteria/checksums/status; independently compile fresh harness\" / GO(p) ⇒ AddedShapes(p)={InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource,NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback} / GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p) ∧ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\n§ properties complete? yes\n§ independence: shape omission and stale/noncompiling evidence independently falsify separate properties.\nRetained properties: property [1]: \"GO(p) ⇒ AddedShapes(p)={InvalidComponent,NilTransferSource,NilBorrowAcquisition,ErrorCallback}\"; property [2]: \"GO(p) ⇒ PriorGreen(p) ∧ ChecksumsExact(p) ∧ StatusExact(p) ∧ ∃h(Fresh(h)∧Compile(h)∧Vet(h))\"\n§ ground complete\n\nPresumed: a unique `/tmp` directory is acceptable for the disposable harness.\nRevised if: the corrected package requires another exact harness location.\n\nGate: Search rationale: final corrected ADR0011 V3 four-call-shape acceptance rereview — retrieve relevant retained constraints before repository reads.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_086e788cb8bf6932016ace56401150819187a700a0e987cc63\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b80bfa141814472591125c1b9fd8a8f5|fc_086e788cb8bf6932016ace56559ca881918ab4a605e9527fc5","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"nn list --search \"final corrected ADR0011 V3 four call shape acceptance rereview\" --json --fields id,title,score,match_reason","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":3821,"output":1786,"cacheRead":134016,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":42,"totalTokens":139623,"cost":{"input":0.015283999999999999,"output":0.03572,"cacheRe